#ASSERT `Under section 462.31(2.3), may the court infer that I knew or believed the property was proceeds of crime, or was reckless as to whether it was` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- SEAT14d s462.31(2.3)-(2.4) I am also charged with the designated offence: the inference does not apply
#ASSERT `Under section 462.34(2)(a), is my application barred from being heard by a judge` TRUE FALSE TRUE 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- SEAT14e s462.34(2)(a) one clear day's notice and no consent: barred ("unless at least two clear days")
#ASSERT `Under section 462.34(2)(a), is my application barred from being heard by a judge` TRUE FALSE TRUE 2 EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- SEAT14f s462.34(2)(a) two clear days' notice: not barred
